    "exact_preliminary_finding": "All exact_error now emit error-graph.v2, but supervisor.check_inner still reads inner.failure.type/message and caller.validate_canonical/validate_entry compares failure to old {type,message}. Both startup controls and both supervisor-entry controls cannot match original oracles in ordinary stock environment. Include both producer+consumer full schema/oracle/raw joins. Original controls/oracles unchanged; do not simply mask or copy expected output."
